            "answer": "<p>Returns are easy and risk-free. If an item doesn't fit your space or meet your standards, just let us know within 90 days of receiving your order. Your return will be completely free. We’ll arrange a pickup time that works for you and collect it from your delivery address. You won’t need to return anything yourself. </p><p>Once we receive it back at our warehouse, we’ll refund 100% of your money in 1-3 Business Days. Every order is backed by our 100% Money Back Guarantee.</p>"
