hatter proof glass</span></div>\n{% endif %}\n{% endfor %}\n\n</div>\n{% comment %}\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; \">\n{% if product.variants[0].inventory_quantity > 0 %}\n{% for tag in product.tags %}\n{% if tag == 'pre-order' and product.variants[0].inventory_quantity < 16 %}\n<div class=\"instock-pulse\">\n<span class=\"icon--pulsing\"></span>\n<span>Free UK Delivery: Available for pre order</span>\n</div>\n{% elsif tag == 'pre-order' %}\n<div class=\"instock-pulse\">\n<span class=\"icon--pulsing\"></span>\n<span>Free UK Delivery: Available for pre order</span>\n</div>\n{% endif %}\n{% endfor %}\n\n{% unless product.tags contains 'pre-order' %}\n{% if product.available and product.variants[0].inventory_quantity < 16 %}\n{% unless product.tags contains 'PF' %}\n<div class=\"instock-pulse\">\n<span class=\"icon--pulsing\"></span>\n<span>Free UK Delivery: <b>In stock</b> and ready to ship</span>\n</div>\n{% else %}\n<div class=\"instock-pulse\">\n<span class=\"icon--pulsing\"></span>\n<span>Free UK Delivery: In stock and ready to ship</span>\n</div>\n{% endunless %}\n{% else %}\n{% unless product.tags contains 'PF' %}\n<div class=\"instock-pulse\">\n<span class=\"icon--pulsing\"></span>\n<span>Free UK Delivery: <b>In stock</b> and ready to ship</span>\n</div>\n{% else %}\n<div class=\"instock-pulse\">\n<span class=\"icon--pulsing\"></span>\n<span>Free UK Delivery: <b>In stock</b> and ready to ship</span>\n</div>\n{% endunless %}\n{% endif %}\n{% endunless %}\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<style>\n\n{% if product.available %}\n.instock-pulse {\ndisplay: flex;\nflex-wrap: nowrap;\nalign-items: center;\njustify-content: center;\nmargin: 2px -4px 0;\n}\n\n.icon--pulsing {\nposition: relative;\nwidth: 20px;\nheight: 20px;\nmargin-right: 4px;\n}\n\n.icon--pulsing:after,\n.icon--pulsing:before {\nbackground: #54c63a;\nwidth: 10px;\nheight: 10px;\nborder-radius: 10px;\nposition: absolute;\nleft: 0;\ntop: 0;\ncontent: \"\";\nmargin: 5px;\n}\n\n@keyframes inventory-pulse {\n0% {\nopacity: 0.5;\n}\nto {\ntransform: scale(2.5);\nopacity: 0;\n}\n}\n{% endif %}\n\n{% if product.variants[0].inventory_quantity >= 11 %}\n.icon--pulsing:before {\nanimation: inventory-pulse 2.5s linear infinite;\n}\n{% elsif product.variants[0].inventory_quantity < 11 and product.variants[0].inventory_quantity > 1 %}\n.icon--pulsing:before {\nanimation: inventory-pulse 1.5s linear infinite;\n}\n{% else %}\n.icon--pulsing:before {\nanimation: inventory-pulse 1s linear infinite;\n}\n{% endif %}\n</style>\n{% endif %}\n\n{% endcomment %}\n\n\n{% if product.tags contains 'pre-order' %}\n\n<div class=\"icon-blocks-container\">\n  <div class=\"icon-block\">\n    <div class=\"icon-block__icon\">\n      <img src=\"{{ 'Icons _Order Instantly.svg' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Free Shipping\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"icon-block__number\">Step 1</div>\n    <h3 class=\"icon-block__title\">Order instantly today</h3>\n    <div class=\"icon-block__description\">Simply tap the <b>add to bag button</b> and checkout <b>securely</b> today to get your order in progress.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"icon-block\">\n    <div class=\"icon-block__icon\">\n      <img src=\"{{ 'Icons _Fast Delivery.svg' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Easy Returns\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"icon-block__number\">Step 2</div>\n    <h3 class=\"icon-block__title\">We ship your order from the date above</h3>\n    <div class=\"icon-block__description\">Once the Pre Order date arrives, our warehouse team carefully prepares your order for <b>safe & secure</b> delivery by your dedicated William Wood driver.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"icon-block\">\n    <div class=\"icon-block__icon\">\n      <img src=\"{{ 'Icons _Love Your Home.svg' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"24/7 Support\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"icon-block__number\">Step 3</div>\n    <h3 class=\"icon-block__title\">Be more p