            "content": "<p><strong>Yes you can.<br/><br/></strong>Select the provided option at the delivery stage of checkout and select your desired date.<strong><br/><br/>or</strong></p><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\">hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</a> after placing your order, quoting your order number and the date you want to hold your order until. An advisor will be happy to assist you.</p><p><strong>Note: </strong>We can only hold orders for up to 90 days from the date of your purchase.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
